      105: <main>
      106: 	<header>
      107: 		<h1>Code review: diff budget, from main</h1>
      108: 		<p class="sub">One defect reaches both axes: the whole-diff fast path skips the token ceiling, so the budget does not bound what it claims to bound.</p>
      109: 		<div class="meta">
      110: 			<span class="chip">2026-10-05</span>
      111: 			<span class="chip">scope: sillajje-core, sillajje-jj, sillajje adapter</span>
      112: 			<span class="chip">fixed point: main</span>
      113: 		</div>
      114: 	</header>
      115: 
      116: 	<nav class="toc">
      117: 		<a href="#summary">Summary</a>
      118: 		<a href="#standards">Standards</a>
      119: 		<a href="#spec">Spec</a>
      120: 		<a href="#verification">Verification</a>
      121: 	</nav>
