      221: 				<tr><td><code>pnpm run knip</code></td><td>fails on <code>TEST_WORKSPACES_ROOT</code> in <code>extensions/sillajje/test/integration/_helpers.ts</code> — pre-existing, file untouched by this diff</td></tr>
      222: 			</tbody>
