      105: <main>
      106: 	<header>
      107: 		<h1>Diff size in the sillajje sub-generator</h1>
      108: 		<p class="sub">The full diff goes into every prompt, with no size cap. The fix is a per-file budget that keeps paths and drops content.</p>
      109: 		<div class="meta">
